.. Don't worry about it. A—Anyway, thanks for buying our short-term investment coupon!","nextNodeIds":[761530119]},{"nodeId":761530119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":2137389410,"text":"Here's your investment return. Have a wonderful day!","nextNodeIds":[761530120,761530121]},{"nodeId":761530120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2277048714,"text":"Well... making money is always a good thing, I suppose...","nextNodeIds":[761530122]},{"nodeId":761530122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1113305498,"text":"Really? Heehee, then Paimon wants one shaped like a little bird! That's Paimon's favorite!","nextNodeIds":[761530123]},{"nodeId":761530123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":4068228818,"text":"Oh? I'll come with you two then. I can get one for Boss too.","nextNodeIds":[761530124]},{"nodeId":761530124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":1978620450,"text":"M-Miss Jahoda, please wait!","nextNodeIds":[761530125]},{"nodeId":761530125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":1694318850,"text":"Um... Do you happen to have a message for me from Lady Nefer by any chance...?","nextNodeIds":[761530126]},{"nodeId":761530126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":1916149154,"text":"Oh. Boss said, \"We've located what you're looking for.\"","nextNodeIds":[761530127]},{"nodeId":761530127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1317,"speakerName":"Jahoda","textMapHash":2770243682,"text":"\"Do have patience, Mr. Dhabit. One step at a time — that's how proper business is done.\"","nextNodeIds":[761530128]},{"nodeId":761530128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":7008,"speakerName":"Dhabit","textMapHash":2454263594,"text":"Yes, yes, of course. Lady Nefer is right... In 